# The build context that travels to the Fly builder.
#
# The Dockerfile only copies `src/` and `data/`, but without this file the whole
# folder is uploaded to the builder first: 33 MB instead of 0.3 MB, of which
# 22 MB is the local virtual environment and 5 MB is the git history.

# Local environment and packages downloaded to work offline
.venv/
venv/
wheels/

# History and automation
.git/
.gitignore
.github/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# What must never enter the image, and it is a security decision, not a size
# one (A3.7): the classification criterion and the code that would make the call
# to the model.
prompts/
scripts/
tests/

# Documents. They belong to the repository, not to the machine that runs.
*.md

# Deployment configuration. `flyctl` reads it from disk before building; the
# container has no use for it.
fly.toml

# Editors, operating system, credentials
.vscode/
.DS_Store
.env
*.key
